- [wasmerio/wasmer](https://github.com/wasmerio/wasmer) via `@wasmer/sdk` 0.16.0, Modified MIT (Copyright (c) 2026 Wasmer, Inc.), runs the WASIX compiler driver in the browser.
- [vitejs/vite](https://github.com/vitejs/vite), MIT, [privatenumber/tsx](https://github.com/privatenumber/tsx), MIT, and [evanw/esbuild](https://github.com/evanw/esbuild), MIT, provide the build and test tooling.
- [microsoft/TypeScript](https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript), Apache-2.0, provides the compiler and type definitions.
